Gladys Gemini TTS integration
Copyright 2026 William-De71

This product sends the texts Gladys speaks (scene notifications and the
replies of the voice assistant) to the Gemini API
(https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com), with the API key of the
administrator, to turn them into speech.

